Prism @PROJECT_VERSION@
@PRISM_README_UNDERLINE@

A photo editor for PNG, JPEG and camera RAW files, with a command-line tool for the same
processing. @PRISM_README_PLATFORM@.

https://github.com/Peaperfish/prism

