Licences
--------

Prism is under the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0 (see LICENSE.md).

It includes LibRaw @PRISM_LIBRAW_VERSION@, used under the Common Development and Distribution
License (CDDL) 1.0. LibRaw's licence files are in licenses/LibRaw/. Its source code is attached
to this release on GitHub as LibRaw-@PRISM_LIBRAW_VERSION@-source.tar.gz, and is available from
https://www.libraw.org/. The other components and their licences are listed in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.
